1943+ 7C9E              .advance_crumble_cell:
1944+ 7C9E                  ; Input: B = Row, C = Col
1945+ 7C9E C5               push bc
1946+ 7C9F D5               push de
1947+ 7CA0 E5               push hl
1948+ 7CA1
1949+ 7CA1                  ; 1. Calcola offset in crumbling_grid: HL = Row * 32 + Col
1950+ 7CA1 68               ld   l, b
