 707+ 875B              ; Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore
 708+ 875B              ; Se player_score > high_score, copia player_score in high_score.
 709+ 875B              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------
 710+ 875B              Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore:
 711+ 875B                  ; Confronto BCD a 3 byte (big-endian: byte 2 -> byte 1 -> byte 0)
 712+ 875B                  ; Byte 2:
 713+ 875B 3A 5E F0         ld   a, (player_score + 2)
